ularly emphasizes the impact of nutrition on various health conditions, including liver disease and acute pancreatitis. This area of research aims to understand how diet and nutrition influence overall health and the progression of diseases, thereby contributing to improved dietary recommendations and interventions for patients suffering from these conditions.", "NUTRITIONAL OUTCOMES IN ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional outcomes in acute pancreatitis refer to the results of nutritional interventions on patients suffering from this condition.", "NUTRITIONAL STRATEGIES IN ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional strategies in acute pancreatitis are specific approaches to providing nutrition to patients with this condition.", "NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT GUIDELINES:Nutritional support guidelines are recommendations for providing nutrition to patients with specific medical conditions, including acute pancreatitis.", "NUTRITIONAL INTERVENTIONS IN ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional interventions in acute pancreatitis are specific strategies implemented to improve the nutritional status of affected patients.", "NUTRITIONAL THERAPY IN ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional therapy in acute pancreatitis involves dietary modifications and interventions aimed at managing the condition.", "NUTRITIONAL ASSESSMENT IN ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional assessment in acute pancreatitis is the evaluation of patients' dietary intake and nutritional needs to guide treatment.", "NUTRITIONAL OUTCOMES IN SEVERE ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional outcomes in severe acute pancreatitis refer to the results of nutritional interventions on patients with this more serious form of the condition.", "NUTRITIONAL STRATEGIES IN SEVERE ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional strategies in severe acute pancreatitis are specific approaches to providing nutrition to patients with this serious condition.", "NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT IN SEVERE ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional support in severe acute pancreatitis refers to the strategies and methods used to provide adequate nutrition to patients suffering from this serious condition.", "NUTRITIONAL GUIDELINES FOR ACUTE PANCREATITIS:Nutritional guidelines for acute pancreatitis are recommendations for dietary practices aimed at improving health outcomes in affected patients.", "NUTRITIONAL OUTCOMES IN PANCREATITIS:Nutritional outcomes in pancreatitis refer", "DR. MARÍA ARGENTE PLA:A medical doctor involved in a clinical case of a diabetic patient with cystic fibrosis.", "DR. ROSA Mª MIRETE LÓPEZ:A medical doctor involved in a clinical case of a patient with diabetes mellitus and inflammatory bowel disease.", "GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA:GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA is a surgical procedure designed to create an opening into the stomach, primarily for the purpose of providing nutritional support to patients who experience difficulties with swallowing. This procedure involves the placement of a feeding tube directly into the stomach, which is particularly beneficial for individuals suffering from esophageal obstruction or other medical conditions that hinder the use of endoscopic techniques for feeding. Overall, GASTROSTOMÍA QUIRÚRGICA serves as a critical intervention for patients requiring alternative methods of nutrition delivery."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}